{
  "id": "edr",
  "term": "EDR",
  "definition": "EDR stands for effective detection radius, the estimated distance around a static passive acoustic monitoring device within which its detection performance is summarized. It is the distance where missed detections close to the detector balance recorded detections farther away, within a set maximum range, and it can be used to estimate the area effectively monitored.",
